      "message": "+1 to everything Andrew said.\n\nI suppose you\u0027re interested in the virtio drivers? If so, feel free to either directly depend on the `virtio-drivers` crate or carve out the bits you need into a stand-alone library.\n\nFYI, see resolved comments on go/trusty-binder-vsock.",
